<title>UK: L-Bank sets 10 bln peseta five-year Matador bond.</title>
<headline>L-Bank sets 10 bln peseta five-year Matador bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Central Hispanoamericano and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   L-BANK</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    22.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE   MATADOR	 ISS PRICE  100.774   PAY DATE    22.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AIAF/MAD  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
